{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_44603","headline":"诗三百三首 三百 · 寒山","name":"诗三百三首 三百","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"出生三十年，当游千万里。\n行江青草合，入塞红尘起。\n链药空求仙，读书兼咏史。\n今日归寒山，枕流兼洗耳。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"寒山","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_44603.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_44603","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}